repower:</strong> From standard rounds to apocalyptic atomic shells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crew with attitude:</strong> Each crew member brings unique abilities to support your rampage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful combos:</strong> Mix and match your crew for synergies that unleash mayhem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource gathering:</strong> Fuel, ammo, health, and nukes keep you moving forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank progression:</strong> Climb from Captain to General, unlocking new perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five game modes:</strong> Quest, Stroll, Challenge, Battle and Raze — each with unique objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local chaos:</strong> Team up on the same keyboard for co-op carnage, or face off in head-to-head battles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest</strong> – Blast through enemy territory, crush their defences, and take down their ruthless dictator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stroll</strong> – An endless march of explosions in enemy lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> – Enemies grow stronger each level until you’re inevitably defeated. Compete for bragging rights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> – Two players, one battlefield, one survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raze</strong> – A casual mode with no real goal… except blowing stuff up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054550/extras/9e18caafc86d5876203802f141c580ba.poster.avif?t=1763667461\" width=600 height=338 ><source 